# No Cursor Canvas Unless Requested

Default all answers to chat. Do not create, edit, or open a Cursor canvas
unless Crystal explicitly asks for one (for example: "use a canvas", "make
a .canvas.tsx", or "put this on a canvas").

## Forbidden unless explicitly requested

- Creating or writing any `*.canvas.tsx` file
- Reading or following the Cursor `canvas` skill
- Offering or switching to a canvas as a "better" presentation for tables,
  MCP results, audits, or reports

## Allowed

- Continue in this chat with markdown, lists, and citations
- Use a canvas only after an explicit request in the current conversation

